## 二、目录结构

```
docs/events/
├── 20260709/
│   └── events.jsonl
├── 20260710/
│   └── events.jsonl
└── ...
```

每个 `events.jsonl` 文件是一行一个 JSON 对象：

```jsonl
{"type":"TASK_STATUS_CHANGED","timestamp":"...","session":"...","payload":{...}}
{"type":"REVIEW_RESULT","timestamp":"...","session":"...","payload":{...}}
```

